---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
import PageStage from '../components/PageStage.astro'
---
<Base title="Website terms" description="Terms for the Birdi Hardwares website: illustrative images, general guidance, prices on request and WhatsApp enquiries." path="/terms/" crumbs={[{ name: 'Website terms', href: '/terms/' }]}>
  <main>
    <PageStage kicker="Terms" title="Website terms." lead="Please read this before relying on anything on this website." actions={false} />
    <article class="band guide-body">
      <section><h2>About this website</h2><p>This is the website of Birdi Hardwares, Lakkar Bazar, Ludhiana, at birdihardwares.com. It describes products and types of hardware to ask about; it is not a shop and nothing is sold through it.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Business details</h2><p>The phone and WhatsApp number, +91 62845 05353, is confirmed by the shop. The address comes from public business listings. Opening hours are not listed yet.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Products, images and films</h2><p>Categories and item types describe kinds of hardware to ask about. Catalogue products, model codes, finishes and sizes are shown as printed in the FANCY and ROOT manufacturers' catalogues, with their catalogue photos; FANCY and ROOT are their own brands. None of this is a stock list, and no stock level, dealership, warranty or service is claimed. Other images are illustrations and 3D renders, and the films are original 3D animations made for this website. None of them is a photograph of the shop's stock.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Prices</h2><p>No prices are shown. Every item is price on request.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Guides</h2><p>Buying guides are general information. Figures described as typical come from published manufacturer data and standards summaries. Check the specification of any item before you buy or fit it, and use a qualified fitter where needed.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Enquiries</h2><p>The enquiry forms do not send anything from this website. They open WhatsApp with your message for you to check and send yourself.</p></section>
    </article>
  </main>
</Base>
